{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: OCR extracts worksheet, AI tutor gives hints with guardrails, escalation flags teacher for review."}
{"t":"assume","id":"channel","text":"Students submit photos via web upload or chat app"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scope","text":"One run processes one student worksheet photo"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many worksheet photos are submitted per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome means success, and what is today's baseline?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive worksheet photo","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"private":true}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-in","kind":"guard","label":"Screen uploaded image","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"ocr","kind":"ai","label":"Extract worksheet text","task":"extract","ai":"qwen-vl-ocr","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"tutor","kind":"ai","label":"Generate pedagogical hint","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-out","kind":"guard","label":"Screen hint for answers","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"decide","kind":"decide","label":"Route response path","task":"check","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"deliver","kind":"act","label":"Deliver hint to student","effect":"reply","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"flag","kind":"act","label":"Flag teacher for review","effect":"notify","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-ok","kind":"end","label":"Hint delivered","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-flag","kind":"end","label":"Teacher notified","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"upload-guard","from":"upload","to":"guard-in"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-ocr","from":"guard-in","to":"ocr"}
{"t":"link","id":"ocr-tutor","from":"ocr","to":"tutor"}
{"t":"link","id":"tutor-guard","from":"tutor","to":"guard-out"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-decide","from":"guard-out","to":"decide"}
{"t":"link","id":"decide-deliver","from":"decide","to":"deliver","kind":"branch","label":"Safe hint only"}
{"t":"link","id":"decide-flag","from":"decide","to":"flag","kind":"branch","label":"Contains answer or unsafe"}
{"t":"link","id":"deliver-end","from":"deliver","to":"end-ok"}
{"t":"link","id":"flag-end","from":"flag","to":"end-flag"}
{"t":"done","summary":"AI tutor workflow: guarded OCR extraction, hint generation that avoids direct answers, safety screening, and teacher escalation on violations."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: PR review agent with sandbox test execution, noise filtering, and human approval gate before posting comments."}
{"t":"assume","id":"pr-source","text":"PR events arrive via webhook from GitHub or GitLab"}
{"t":"assume","id":"volume","text":"Under 100 pull requests per day"}
{"t":"step","id":"pr-trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"PR webhook event","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"effect":"read","why":"Entry point receiving PR payload from version control system"}
{"t":"step","id":"input-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen PR payload","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Detect prompt injection in PR titles, descriptions, or diff content"}
{"t":"step","id":"review-agent","kind":"agent","label":"Code review agent","task":"review","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"agentrun","turns":10,"tool":"code_interpreter","why":"Orchestrates diff analysis, test execution, and comment drafting with bounded turns"}
{"t":"step","id":"filter-noise","kind":"ai","label":"Filter noisy comments","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","after":"review-agent","why":"Remove trivial or low-signal suggestions before human review"}
{"t":"step","id":"human-approve","kind":"human","label":"Approve PR comments","task":"approve","subject":"filter-noise","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","after":"filter-noise","why":"Final human gate before publishing any automated feedback on the PR"}
{"t":"step","id":"post-comments","kind":"act","label":"Post approved comments","effect":"publish","runs":"fc","after":"human-approve","why":"Write approved review comments back to the pull request via API"}
{"t":"step","id":"posted","kind":"end","label":"Comments posted","runs":"customer","after":"post-comments"}
{"t":"step","id":"declined","kind":"end","label":"Review declined","runs":"customer","after":"human-approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"trigger-guard","from":"pr-trigger","to":"input-guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-agent","from":"input-guard","to":"review-agent"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-filter","from":"review-agent","to":"filter-noise"}
{"t":"link","id":"filter-approve","from":"filter-noise","to":"human-approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-post","from":"human-approve","to":"post-comments","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-decline","from":"human-approve","to":"declined","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-edit","from":"human-approve","to":"filter-noise","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"post-done","from":"post-comments","to":"posted"}
{"t":"ask","id":"vcs-platform","text":"Which version control platform hosts your repositories?","options":["GitHub","GitLab","Other"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"AgentRun coding agent reviews PR diffs, runs tests in sandbox, filters noise, and requires human approval before publishing comments."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: extract clauses, retrieve playbook, compare, draft redlines, then lawyer approval before delivery."}
{"t":"assume","id":"playbook-store","text":"Legal playbook is stored in a vector database"}
{"t":"assume","id":"delivery-method","text":"Approved redlines are emailed to the lawyer"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many contracts are uploaded per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome means success, and what is today's baseline review time?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Contract upload trigger","runs":"fc","untrusted":true}
{"t":"step","id":"parse","kind":"tool","label":"Parse contract PDF","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","untrusted":true}
{"t":"step","id":"screen","kind":"guard","label":"Screen parsed content","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract","kind":"ai","label":"Extract contract clauses","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"embed","kind":"knowledge","label":"Embed extracted clauses","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"retrieve","kind":"knowledge","label":"Retrieve playbook rules","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"rank","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rank playbook matches","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"compare","kind":"ai","label":"Compare clauses to playbook","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"draft","kind":"ai","label":"Draft redline suggestions","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Lawyer approves redlines","task":"approve","subject":"draft","runs":"cloudflow"}
{"t":"step","id":"deliver","kind":"act","label":"Send approved redlines","effect":"send","product":"direct-mail","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"sent","kind":"end","label":"Redlines delivered","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"rejected","kind":"end","label":"Redlines rejected","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"upload-parse","from":"upload","to":"parse"}
{"t":"link","id":"parse-screen","from":"parse","to":"screen"}
{"t":"link","id":"screen-extract","from":"screen","to":"extract"}
{"t":"link","id":"extract-embed","from":"extract","to":"embed"}
{"t":"link","id":"embed-retrieve","from":"embed","to":"retrieve"}
{"t":"link","id":"retrieve-rank","from":"retrieve","to":"rank"}
{"t":"link","id":"rank-compare","from":"rank","to":"compare"}
{"t":"link","id":"compare-draft","from":"compare","to":"draft"}
{"t":"link","id":"draft-approve","from":"draft","to":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-deliver","from":"approve","to":"deliver","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-rejected","from":"approve","to":"rejected","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-edit","from":"approve","to":"draft","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"deliver-sent","from":"deliver","to":"sent"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Contract clause extraction workflow with playbook retrieval, comparison, redline drafting, and lawyer approval gate before email delivery."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: OCR and vision extraction, policy check, payout approval gate. Untrusted uploads plus private policies need screening and approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"policy-store","text":"Policies stored in a customer database or vector store","alt":"Policies provided inline with each claim"}
{"t":"assume","id":"payout-sys","text":"Payouts executed via a customer finance API","alt":"Payouts handled manually after approval"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many claims are submitted per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive claim upload","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for uploaded photos and PDFs"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-in","kind":"guard","label":"Screen uploaded files","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection or harmful content in untrusted uploads"}
{"t":"step","id":"route-file","kind":"decide","label":"Route by file type","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Separate handling for images versus PDFs"}
{"t":"step","id":"ocr-pdf","kind":"tool","label":"Parse PDF text","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Extract structured text from claim PDF documents"}
{"t":"step","id":"vision-img","kind":"ai","label":"Extract image data","task":"see","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Read claim details, damage or receipts from photos"}
{"t":"step","id":"merge","kind":"ai","label":"Merge extracted data","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","join":"all","why":"Combine outputs from both file-type branches into one record"}
{"t":"step","id":"policy-check","kind":"agent","label":"Verify against policy","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","turns":5,"private":true,"why":"Cross-reference extracted claim data with private policy rules"}
{"t":"step","id":"risk","kind":"decide","label":"Assess payout risk","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Determine if the claim needs human approval before payout"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Approve payout","task":"approve","subject":"policy-check","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Gate consequential financial decision per shared policy"}
{"t":"step","id":"pay","kind":"act","label":"Execute payout","effect":"pay","runs":"customer","approval":"required","why":"Call customer finance system to disburse funds"}
{"t":"step","id":"done-pay","kind":"end","label":"Payout completed","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"denied","kind":"end","label":"Claim denied","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"up-guard","from":"upload","to":"guard-in"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-route","from":"guard-in","to":"route-file"}
{"t":"link","id":"route-pdf","from":"route-file","to":"ocr-pdf","kind":"branch","label":"PDF file"}
{"t":"link","id":"route-img","from":"route-file","to":"vision-img","kind":"branch","label":"Image file"}
{"t":"link","id":"pdf-merge","from":"ocr-pdf","to":"merge"}
{"t":"link","id":"img-merge","from":"vision-img","to":"merge"}
{"t":"link","id":"merge-policy","from":"merge","to":"policy-check"}
{"t":"link","id":"policy-risk","from":"policy-check","to":"risk"}
{"t":"link","id":"risk-approve","from":"risk","to":"approve","kind":"branch","label":"Needs approval"}
{"t":"link","id":"risk-deny","from":"risk","to":"denied","kind":"branch","label":"Policy violation"}
{"t":"link","id":"appr-pay","from":"approve","to":"pay","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"appr-deny","from":"approve","to":"denied","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"pay-done","from":"pay","to":"done-pay"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Prompt chain extracting claim data from photos and PDFs, checking policies via agent, and gating payouts with human approval."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: a scheduled AgentRun loop checks flight statuses, researches rebooking options, and routes to human approval before acting."}
{"t":"assume","id":"flight-api","text":"Customer exposes a flight status and booking API adapter"}
{"t":"assume","id":"channel","text":"Approvals are delivered via an existing chat or email channel"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many flights or passengers should be monitored per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline?"}
{"t":"step","id":"sched","kind":"trigger","label":"Scheduled flight check","product":"schedulerx","runs":"fc","why":"Periodically trigger the monitoring agent"}
{"t":"step","id":"monitor","kind":"agent","label":"Monitor and propose rebooking","task":"plan","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","tool":"mcp","turns":10,"runs":"agentrun","approval":"skip","why":"Agent loops over flights, calls status API, detects disruptions and drafts rebooking options"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-out","kind":"guard","label":"Screen proposal content","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Prevent private data leaks or harmful text in outbound proposals"}
{"t":"step","id":"decide","kind":"decide","label":"Route disruption decision","task":"decide","runs":"fc","why":"Branch only when a real disruption with options exists"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Approve rebooking option","task":"approve","subject":"monitor","runs":"cloudflow","why":"Rebooking is a financial commitment requiring explicit human approval"}
{"t":"step","id":"rebook","kind":"act","label":"Execute approved rebooking","effect":"pay","runs":"customer","tool":"mcp","approval":"required","why":"Call customer booking system to apply the approved change"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-rebooked","kind":"end","label":"Rebooking completed","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-declined","kind":"end","label":"Proposal declined or timeout","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-clear","kind":"end","label":"No disruptions found","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"sched-monitor","from":"sched","to":"monitor"}
{"t":"link","id":"monitor-guard","from":"monitor","to":"guard-out"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-decide","from":"guard-out","to":"decide"}
{"t":"link","id":"decide-approve","from":"decide","to":"approve","kind":"branch","label":"Disruption detected with options"}
{"t":"link","id":"decide-clear","from":"decide","to":"end-clear","kind":"branch","label":"All flights normal"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-rebook","from":"approve","to":"rebook","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-declined","from":"approve","to":"end-declined","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-edit","from":"approve","to":"monitor","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-timeout","from":"approve","to":"end-declined","kind":"branch","outcome":"timeout"}
{"t":"link","id":"rebook-end","from":"rebook","to":"end-rebooked"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Scheduled AgentRun monitors flights via MCP, proposes rebooking through a guard and decide step, then gates execution behind CloudFlow human approval."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: vision extraction, parallel translation, human approval gate before marketplace publish. Untrusted supplier photos plus private catalog data require screening and approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"img-src","text":"Supplier photos arrive via OSS upload trigger"}
{"t":"assume","id":"langs","text":"Target languages: English, Chinese, Thai, Bahasa"}
{"t":"assume","id":"vol","text":"Hundreds of product photos per day"}
{"t":"ask","id":"q-vol","text":"How many product photos do you process per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"q-success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline listing time?"}
{"t":"each","id":"lang-loop","over":"en,zh,th,id","parallel":true}
{"t":"step","id":"trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"Photo upload event","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Starts pipeline when supplier uploads a new photo to OSS"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-img","kind":"guard","label":"Screen supplier image","product":"content-moderation","runs":"fc","why":"Block harmful or non-product images from entering the pipeline"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract","kind":"ai","label":"Extract product attributes","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Vision model extracts color, material, dimensions and category from photo"}
{"t":"step","id":"draft-en","kind":"ai","label":"Draft SEO listing","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"fc","repeat":"lang-loop","why":"Generates localized SEO title, bullets and description per language"}
{"t":"step","id":"assemble","kind":"ai","label":"Assemble multilingual listing","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","join":"all","why":"Combines all translated drafts into one structured listing document"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Merchandiser review","task":"approve","subject":"assemble","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Human gate required for publish effect to external marketplaces"}
{"t":"step","id":"pub-amazon","kind":"act","label":"Push to Amazon","effect":"publish","runs":"customer","why":"Calls Amazon SP-API to create or update the product listing"}
{"t":"step","id":"pub-shopee","kind":"act","label":"Push to Shopee","effect":"publish","runs":"customer","why":"Calls Shopee Open API to create or update the product listing"}
{"t":"step","id":"done-pub","kind":"end","label":"Listings published","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"rejected","kind":"end","label":"Listing rejected","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-trig-guard","from":"trigger","to":"guard-img"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-ext","from":"guard-img","to":"extract"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-ext-draft","from":"extract","to":"draft-en"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-draft-asm","from":"draft-en","to":"assemble"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-asm-appr","from":"assemble","to":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-appr-amz","from":"approve","to":"pub-amazon","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-appr-shp","from":"approve","to":"pub-shopee","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-appr-rej","from":"approve","to":"rejected","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-amz-done","from":"pub-amazon","to":"done-pub"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-shp-done","from":"pub-shopee","to":"done-pub"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Designed a prompt-chain pipeline with vision extraction, parallel multilingual drafting, merchandiser approval gate, and dual marketplace publishing."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: OCR extraction, regulation check, risk flagging, human approval via CloudFlow callback before final submission."}
{"t":"assume","id":"dest-country","text":"Destination country is extracted from invoice metadata.","alt":"User provides destination country as input parameter."}
{"t":"assume","id":"submission-target","text":"Submission target is an external customs API endpoint.","alt":"Submission is a manual download for the officer."}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many customs document sets are processed per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline processing time or error rate?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload-trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive uploaded documents","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"private":true,"effect":"read","why":"Entry point for uploaded invoices and packing lists"}
{"t":"step","id":"input-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen uploaded files","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Validate untrusted uploads for malicious content or prompt injection"}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-invoice","kind":"tool","label":"Parse customs invoice","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"Extract structured text data from the uploaded customs invoice PDF"}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-packing-list","kind":"tool","label":"Parse packing list","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","private":true,"after":"parse-invoice","why":"Extract structured text data from the uploaded packing list PDF"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract-fields","kind":"ai","label":"Extract structured fields","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","private":true,"join":"all","why":"Normalize parsed text into structured HS codes, values, weights and origins"}
{"t":"step","id":"check-regulations","kind":"agent","label":"Check destination regulations","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"agentrun","turns":5,"tool":"web_search","private":true,"why":"Verify extracted goods against destination-country import rules and restrictions"}
{"t":"step","id":"flag-risks","kind":"ai","label":"Flag compliance risks","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Analyze regulatory check results to classify and flag any compliance risks"}
{"t":"step","id":"draft-report","kind":"ai","label":"Draft compliance report","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Compile extracted data, regulations and risks into a reviewable summary"}
{"t":"step","id":"compliance-approval","kind":"human","label":"Compliance officer approval","task":"approve","subject":"draft-report","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","private":true,"why":"Human gate required before submitting consequential customs declarations"}
{"t":"step","id":"submit-customs","kind":"act","label":"Submit to customs portal","effect":"send","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","private":true,"approval":"required","why":"Deliver the approved customs declaration to the external authority"}
{"t":"step","id":"submitted","kind":"end","label":"Customs submitted","runs":"customer","why":"Successful completion of the workflow"}
{"t":"step","id":"rejected","kind":"end","label":"Submission rejected","runs":"customer","why":"Officer declined the submission"}
{"t":"link","id":"trigger-to-guard","from":"upload-trigger","to":"input-guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-to-parse-inv","from":"input-guard","to":"parse-invoice"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-to-parse-pack","from":"input-guard","to":"parse-packing-list"}
{"t":"link","id":"inv-to-extract","from":"parse-invoice","to":"extract-fields"}
{"t":"link","id":"pack-to-extract","from":"parse-packing-list","to":"extract-fields"}
{"t":"link","id":"extract-to-check","from":"extract-fields","to":"check-regulations"}
{"t":"link","id":"check-to-flag","from":"check-regulations","to":"flag-risks"}
{"t":"link","id":"flag-to-draft","from":"flag-risks","to":"draft-report"}
{"t":"link","id":"draft-to-approval","from":"draft-report","to":"compliance-approval"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-submit","from":"compliance-approval","to":"submit-customs","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-reject","from":"compliance-approval","to":"rejected","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-edit","from":"compliance-approval","to":"draft-report","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"submit-to-end","from":"submit-customs","to":"submitted"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Designed a customs compliance prompt chain with parallel parsing, AI regulation checking, risk flagging, and mandatory human approval before submission."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: guarded chat intake, catalog lookup, coupon validation, AI recommendation, human checkout approval, then order act."}
{"t":"assume","id":"chat-channel","text":"Web chat trigger via Function Compute","alt":"WhatsApp via Chat App Message Service"}
{"t":"assume","id":"catalog-store","text":"Product catalog queried via customer API","alt":"Vector search over product embeddings"}
{"t":"assume","id":"coupon-sys","text":"Coupon codes validated via customer API"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many shopping sessions or product queries do you expect per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success (e.g. conversion rate), and what is today's baseline?"}
{"t":"step","id":"chat-in","kind":"trigger","label":"Shopping chat message","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for customer shopping requests"}
{"t":"step","id":"input-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen inbound request","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection and harmful input before processing"}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-intent","kind":"ai","label":"Parse shopping intent","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Extract product query, preferences and any coupon code"}
{"t":"step","id":"lookup-products","kind":"tool","label":"Query product catalog","task":"retrieve","runs":"customer","effect":"read","why":"Fetch matching products from the customer catalog system"}
{"t":"step","id":"validate-coupon","kind":"tool","label":"Validate coupon code","task":"check","runs":"customer","effect":"read","why":"Verify coupon eligibility and discount before recommending"}
{"t":"step","id":"recommend","kind":"ai","label":"Generate recommendations","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Compose personalized product suggestions with applied discounts"}
{"t":"step","id":"output-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen recommendation reply","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Prevent private data leaks or harmful content in output"}
{"t":"step","id":"deliver-recs","kind":"act","label":"Send recommendations","effect":"reply","runs":"fc","why":"Return the safe recommendation text to the shopper"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve-checkout","kind":"human","label":"Approve coupon checkout","task":"approve","subject":"recommend","approval":"required","runs":"cloudflow","why":"Human must approve financial commitment of coupon application"}
{"t":"step","id":"apply-order","kind":"act","label":"Apply coupon to order","effect":"pay","runs":"customer","approval":"required","why":"Execute the discount application in the customer order system"}
{"t":"step","id":"order-done","kind":"end","label":"Checkout complete","runs":"customer","why":"Successful order completion"}
{"t":"step","id":"order-declined","kind":"end","label":"Checkout declined","runs":"customer","why":"Checkout was rejected by approver"}
{"t":"link","id":"chat-to-guard","from":"chat-in","to":"input-guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-to-parse","from":"input-guard","to":"parse-intent"}
{"t":"link","id":"parse-to-lookup","from":"parse-intent","to":"lookup-products"}
{"t":"link","id":"parse-to-coupon","from":"parse-intent","to":"validate-coupon"}
{"t":"link","id":"lookup-to-rec","from":"lookup-products","to":"recommend","join":"all"}
{"t":"link","id":"coupon-to-rec","from":"validate-coupon","to":"recommend"}
{"t":"link","id":"rec-to-outguard","from":"recommend","to":"output-guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"outguard-to-deliver","from":"output-guard","to":"deliver-recs"}
{"t":"link","id":"deliver-to-approve","from":"deliver-recs","to":"approve-checkout"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-to-apply","from":"approve-checkout","to":"apply-order","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-to-declined","from":"approve-checkout","to":"order-declined","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"apply-to-done","from":"apply-order","to":"order-done"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Shopping assistant prompt chain with parallel catalog and coupon lookups, guarded AI recommendations, and human-approved coupon checkout."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: chat trigger, guard, retrieve handbook, generate answer, confidence check, and human escalation for uncertainty."}
